   "source": [
    "# CU-BEMS Smart Building — Floor 1 EDA\n",
    "\n",
    "**Owner:** Leyna · **Scope:** `data/2018Floor1.csv` (Jul–Dec 2018) + `data/2019Floor1.csv` (Jan–Dec 2019)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** CU-BEMS Smart Building Energy & Indoor Environmental Data (Kaggle) — 1-minute sampling.\n",
    "\n",
    "Outline:\n",
    "1. Setup & load\n",
    "2. Structure, schema & timestamp continuity\n",
    "3. Missing data\n",
    "4. Outliers, spikes & dead channels\n",
    "5. Cleaning rules (applied to a copy)\n",
    "6. Energy consumption over time\n",
    "7. Daily / weekly patterns\n",
    "8. Zone & end-use breakdown\n",
    "9. HVAC (AC) behaviour\n",
    "10. Year-over-year shifts\n",
    "11. Correlations\n",
    "12. Findings summary & next steps\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Reading the code:** every cell is commented. `raw` = the data exactly as loaded; `df` = the cleaned copy (from section 5 on)."
   ]
  },
