   "source": [
    "## 2. Structure, schema & timestamp continuity\n",
    "\n",
    "Column naming is `z<zone>_<end-use>(kW)`. Floor 1 has **power meters only** — no temperature, humidity or lux\n",
    "sensors (unlike some other floors), so indoor-environment questions can't be answered from Floor 1 alone."
   ]
  },
