    "**Missing-data takeaways**\n",
    "- Overall missingness is low (<0.6% for most meters).\n",
    "- **`z2_Plug` is the exception in 2018 (~11%)**: one continuous ~20-day outage from **22 Aug to 11 Sep 2018** — other meters kept reporting.\n",
    "- The rest are short, logger-wide outages (all meters NaN together); the biggest are ~5 h on 17 Aug 2018 and ~4.5 h on 12 Jul 2019.\n",
    "- Short gaps (≤ a few hours) can be safely time-interpolated; the 20-day z2_Plug hole should **not** be interpolated — leave it NaN or exclude that window for z2_Plug analyses."
   ]
