   "source": [
    "## 5. Cleaning rules (applied to a copy)\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Spikes (flagged in section 4) → NaN\n",
    "2. Short gaps (≤ 60 min) → time interpolation\n",
    "3. Longer gaps stay NaN (notably the 20-day z2_Plug outage)\n",
    "4. Derived columns: category totals (Light / Plug / AC) and floor total, in kW. Energy in kWh = mean kW × hours."
   ]
  },
